     - ECM/fibro: `ASPN`, `COL15A1`, `COL26A1`, `DCN`, `FBLN2`, `FBLN5`, `FNDC1`
     - Endothelial/vascular: `CAV1`, `CD34`, `CLDN5`, `GJA5`, `LYVE1`, `NOS3`, `NR2F2`, `PECAM1`, `PGF`
